    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "On motion to recommit with instructions Failed by the Yeas and Nays: 191 - 232 (Roll no. 155). (consideration: CR H2889-2890)",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H8A000",
   "actionDate": "2014-04-03",
   "actionTime": "14:45:05",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "The previous question on the motion to recommit with instructions was ordered without objection. (consideration: CR H2890)",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H8D000",
   "actionDate": "2014-04-03",
   "actionTime": "14:38:20",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Floor summary: DEBATE - The House proceeded with 10 minutes of debate on the Takano motion to recommit with instructions. The instructions contained in the motion seek to report the same back to the House forthwith with an amendment to prohibit the underlying bill from taking effect if any provision results in (1) the loss of health coverage or loss of wages for any employee; (2) an increase in the Federal deficit; (3) the loss of health coverage for veterans and their families; (4) an increase in premiums or out of pocket costs for employees; (5) denial of coverage for pre-existing conditions; or (6) discriminating against women by limiting their access to quality healthcare or decreasing their health coverage.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H36100",
   "actionDate": "2014-04-03",
   "actionTime": "14:37:58",
   "committees": [
    {
     "name": "Ways and Means Committee",
     "systemCode": "hswm00",
     "url": "https://api.congress.gov/v3/committee/house/hswm00?format=json"
    }
   ],
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Mr. Takano moved to recommit with instructions to the Committee on Ways and Means. (consideration: CR H2889-2890; text: CR H2889)",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H35000",
   "actionDate": "2014-04-03",
   "actionTime": "14:37:24",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "The previous question was ordered pursuant to the rule. (consideration: CR H2889)",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H8D000",
   "actionDate": "2014-04-03",
   "actionTime": "12:27:49",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "DEBATE - The House proceeded with the remaining 1 hour and 46 minutes of debate on H.R. 2575.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H30000",
   "actionDate": "2014-04-03",
   "actionTime": "12:27:21",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Considered as unfinished business. (consideration: CR H2861-2891)",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H8D000",
   "actionDate": "2014-04-02",
   "actionTime": "15:38:36",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "POSTPONED PROCEEDINGS - The Chair announced that pursuant to clause 1(c) of rule 19, further proceedings on H.R. 2575 would be postponed.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H8D000",
