   "actionTime": "14:03:59",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Rule provides for consideration of H.R. 2575 with 3 hours of general debate. Previous question shall be considered as ordered without intervening motions except motion to recommit with or without instructions. Measure will be considered read. Bill is closed to amendments.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
